@FlowGate.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:6000

### Проверка живости
GET {{FlowGate.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Сведения о роутере (нужен туннель к RCI: ssh -p 222 -L 7979:127.0.0.1:79 root@192.168.1.1)
GET {{FlowGate.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/keenetic/system
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI
GET {{FlowGate.WebApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
